  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/Logos/logo-forge.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Forge)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">發行版 (Forge)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge (Fabric)</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">發行版 (Fabric)</a>\n    |\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">合併請求</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreeperHost</a> \n    |\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a>\n\n<div>\n  感謝遊玩我們的模組！如果您想支持我們持續開發 Chisels and Bits 的努力，請考慮在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上支持我們。  \n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CreeperHost.png\" alt=\"CreeperHost\">\n  </a>\n\n<div>\n  感謝 CreeperHost 的慷慨贊助，您現在購買伺服器可享受 25% 折扣。點擊上方圖片，或在結帳時使用折扣碼 'chisels-and-bits'！  \n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/ForForge.png\" alt=\"適用於 Forge\">\n\n\n  此版本的模組是專為 Minecraft Forge 開發的。\n  因此，它需要 Forge 才能正常運作。\n\n<div>\n  如果您想在 Fabric 上遊玩 Chisels & Bits，則需要不同版本的模組。該版本專為與 Fabric 及其載入器、API 配合而設計。\n  此特定版本的模組可於此處找到：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Wiki.png\" alt=\"維基\">\n  </a>\n\n\n  我們盡力為模組提供完整的文件說明。\n  您可以在我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chiselsandbits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a> 上找到相關文件。\n  如果發現缺少任何內容，請隨時告知我們！\n\n<div>\n  我們的所有物品、方塊和系統都在那裡有詳細說明。\n</div>\n\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n  </a>\n\n\n  儘管我們擁有專門的維基，涵蓋了 Chisels & Bits 加入遊戲的所有物品、方塊和系統的說明，但我們也設有一個專屬的 Discord 伺服器，您可以在那裡提問、討論想法並獲得模組相關的協助。   \n\n<div>\n  如果您想加入該伺服器，可以點擊上方圖片，或點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。   \n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Contents.png\" alt=\"模組內容\">\n\n\n  《鑿子與碎片》(Chisels and Bits) 是一款 Minecraft 模組，允許您將構成世界的大型方塊進行切割，並將切下的小碎片重新放置。\n  您可以自由發揮創意。\n\n<div>\n  <div>想要更平滑的階梯？盡情嘗試吧。</div>\n  <div>想要更好看的屋頂？或是柱子？現在一切皆有可能。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n  您可以透過混合搭配現有不同方塊的碎片，打造出外觀和手感截然不同的全新方塊。\n</div>\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityVanilla.png\" alt=\"與原版相容性\">\n\n\n  預設情況下，所有實心、簡單的全方塊（如原木、木板、礦石、儲藏方塊（鑽石、綠寶石、鐵等））均支援。\n  此外，部分特定方塊經過手動篩選，特別是所有玻璃方塊、樹葉和草方塊。  \n\n\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityMods.png\" alt=\"與模組相容性\">\n\n\n  相容方塊的掃描功能會自動偵測所有相容的模組方塊。\n  如果模組開發者希望控制其方塊的篩選程序，可以透過將其加入以下兩個標籤之一來實現：\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <code>chiselsandbits:chiselable/forced</code>\n    強制該方塊可被雕刻（適用於玻璃等類似方塊）\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <code> chiselsandbits:chiselable/blocked</code>\n    防止通常可被雕刻的方塊遭到雕刻。\n  </li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
